{"c":[{"name":"20260829T211122Z-ad3d3bf48d2c3470","text":"Leaf identity is content-only: heal drops a loose note whose text already sits inside a pack, silently deleting a just-written note (#77). leafset_id keys on the multiset; leaf_digests keys on the set.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T214451Z-1d8350664f6c3f7d","text":"theory.md argues why it converges: name the system, not summem:line. Architecture owns filenames and functions. Exception: the #77 leak names leafset_id vs leaf_digests because that disagreement is the defect. Do not cite notes.md from 'leaving the cut open is a judgement'.","type":"note"}]}
